## 1. Business Scenario

Sunrise Supermarket sells products to customers who place orders containing one or more items. Management wants to understand customer purchasing activity, customer spending, order history, and sales trends over time.

This assignment uses SQL **JOINs, Common Table Expressions (CTEs), and Window Functions** to answer eight business questions.

The database used for this assignment contains:

| Table | Number of Records |
|---|---:|
| Customers | 5 |
| Products | 8 |
| Orders | 15 |
| Order Items | 27 |

The data satisfies the assignment requirements of at least 5 customers, 8 products across at least 3 categories, 15 orders, and 25 order items.

